; Last Hero — Act 1, joint 1 (docs/plan/2026-10-15-act1.md): the opening battle before the kingdom's walls.
;
; The kingdom's soldiers (the story's ALLY: KayKit adventurers) hold a line before the gate against
; the enemy army and its commander. A beam of light: the hero lands between them and the enemy
; commander is thrown back. He rises and charges; beaten, the commander cuts him down, the army
; breaks, and she takes the hero to the queen (MAP poytaxt). The walls are the rampart kit's
; (FelikinRuslan, CC BY 4.0), standing on the stone west of the field.

